  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zuva reNjodzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo shoko raJehovha rakasvika kwandiri richiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Haufaniri kuwana mukadzi kana kuva navanakomana kana vanasikana panzvimbo ino.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti zvanzi naJehovha, pamusoro pavanakomana navanasikana vanoberekwa munyika ino napamusoro pavakadzi vanova vanamai vavo navarume vanova madzibaba avo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Vachafa nehosha dzakaipisisa. Havangazochemwi kana kuvigwa asi vachafanana nomupfudze uri pamusoro penyika. Vachaparara nomunondo nenzara, uye zvitunha zvavo zvichava zvokudya zveshiri dzedenga nemhuka dzepanyika.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti zvanzi naJehovha: \"Usapinda muimba mune zvokudya zvamariro: usaenda kundochema kana kuvanzwira tsitsi, nokuti ndabvisa maropafadzo norudo rwangu nengoni dzangu pavanhu ava,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Vose, vakuru navaduku vachafa munyika ino. Havangavigwi kana kuchemwa, uye hakuna munhu achazvicheka kana kuveura musoro wake nokuda kwavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuna munhu achavapa chokudya kuti vanyarare pakuchema kwavo vakafa, hakuna kunyange baba chaivo kana mai, hakuna kana achavapa mvura yokunwa chaiyo kuti vanyarare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Newe usapinda muimba inoitirwa mutambo kundogara pasi uchidya nokunwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti zvanzi naJehovha Wamasimba Ose, Mwari weIsraeri: Ndichagumisa panzvimbo ino, muchizviona pamazuva enyu, mheremhere yokupembera nenzwi romufaro uye nenzwi romwenga nerechikomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Paunovaudza vanhu ava izvi zvose ivo vakakubvunza vachiti 'Jehovha aisireiko kwatiri chirevo chenjodzi yakakura kudai? Chakaipa chatakaita ndecheiko? Chivi chedu ndecheiko? Chivi chedu ndecheiko chatakatadzira Jehovha Mwari wedu?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ipapo uti kwavari, 'Nemhaka yokuti madzibaba enyu akandisiya,' ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha, 'vakatevera vamwe vamwari vakavashumira uye vakavanamata. Vakandisiya ini uye havana kuchengeta mirayiro yangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi imi makaita zvakaipa kupfuura madzibaba enyu. Tarirai kuti mumwe nomumwe wenyu anotevera sei kusindimara kwomwoyo wake wakaipa pano kuti anditeerere ini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saka ndichakudzingai panyika ino ndichikuisai kunyika yamusina kumboziva imi kana madzibaba enyu mugondoshumira vamwe vamwari ikoko masikati nousiku, nokuti handingakunzwirei nyasha.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kunyange zvakadaro, mazuva anouya,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha, \"avasingazotizve, 'NaJehovha mupenyu iye akabudisa vaIsraeri muIjipiti,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi vachati, 'NaJehovha mupenyu, akabudisa vaIsraeri kubva munyika yokumusoro uye nokubva munyika dzose dzaakanga avadzingira.' Nokuti ndichavadzoserazve kunyika yandakapa madzitateguru avo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Asi zvino ndichavatumira varedzi vehove vazhinji,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha, \"vagozovabata. Mushure maizvozvo ndichatumira vavhimi vazhinji, vachavavhima pamusoro pegomo roga roga napamusoro pechikomo choga choga uye nomumapako amatombo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meso angu ari pamusoro penzira dzavo dzose; hadzina kuvanzika kwandiri, uye chivi chavo hachina kuvanzika pameso angu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndichatsiva zvakaipa zvavo nechivi chavo, zvakapetwa kaviri, nokuti vakasvibisa nyika yangu nezvitunha zvezvifananidzo zvavo zvisina maturo, uye vakazadza nhaka yangu nezvifananidzo zvavo zvinonyangadza.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imi Jehovha, simba rangu nenhare yangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "utiziro hwangu munguva yokutambudzika,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndudzi dzichauya kwamuri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "dzichibva kumagumo enyika, dzichiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Madzibaba edu akanga asina chaanacho asi vamwari venhema bedzi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "izvo zvifananidzo zvisingabatsiri zvisina chakanaka chazvakavaitira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ko, vanhu vanozviitira vamwari vavo here?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hongu, asi havasi vamwari!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Naizvozvo ndichavadzidzisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nguva ino ndichavadzidzisa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "simba rangu noukuru hwangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 16:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ipapo vachaziva",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 16:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuti zita rangu ndiJehovha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
